NOTE ON SCOPE

This licence covers the documentation and the analysis and firmware code in
this repository.

The photographs are (c) Nguyen Minh Khoi, all rights reserved.

Component specifications quoted for third-party parts remain the property of
their respective manufacturers and are reproduced here for reference only.

This vehicle carries mass on unguarded propellers turning at over 7000 rpm.
This repository documents one build. It is not a construction guide, and
nothing in it has been reviewed for airworthiness. Anyone reproducing any part
of it is responsible for compliance with the aviation regulations that apply to
them and for their own safety practices.
